                "AUTHORIZED_SIGNATORY"
              ],
              "description": "#### Description\n  - This field specifies whether the individual is a **Beneficial Owner** or an **Authorized Signatory**.\n#### Validation\n  - Must be one of the predefined values.\n  - **Beneficial owners** can be at most 4.\n  - **Authorized signatory** can be at most 1.\n  - **Authorized signatory** is **optional**.\n  - **Required** field\n"
            },
            "legalFirstName": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 30,
